Template: biokids-core/purge-data
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Delete the stored BioKids data for this family?
 /var/lib/biokids holds every child's time history, their settings and the audit log. If it is kept, a later reinstallation of BioKids finds it again. If it is deleted, this family's record of computer use is gone for good; that cannot be undone.
